From 80516f8e3f070892195e0f64340cbe661933fe35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabio Paracchini <fparacchini@alteanet.it>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 21:44:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] feat(analytics): add TTFT, Token/s and error metrics as
 per patch 0002

- Add '1h' period filter option to Analytics Dashboard
- Add avg_ttft_ms, avg_tokens_per_second, error_rate columns to model usage table
- Add sort support for new TTFT, Tok/s, Err% columns
- Add userId cross-filter param to getModelAnalytics API call
- Add modelId cross-filter param to getUserAnalytics API call
- Make model rows toggle selectedFilterModelId for user cross-filtering
- Make user rows clickable to toggle selectedFilterUserId for model cross-filtering
- Update hourly granularity to cover both 1h and 24h periods
- Keep upstream unique_users/unique_chats columns and date picker

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
